## SendingApi

### Send a pre-built RFC 822 message verbatim (preserves DKIM)
## Send a pre-built RFC 822 message verbatim (preserves DKIM)
POST https://api.mailbaby.net/mail/rawsend
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Type: multipart/form-data
Accept: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}

{
 "raw_email": "<string>",
 "id": "<number>"
}


### Send email with multiple recipients, CC/BCC, attachments, named contacts
## Send email with multiple recipients, CC/BCC, attachments, named contacts
POST https://api.mailbaby.net/mail/advsend
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}

### Send a simple email (single recipient, plain or HTML)
## Send a simple email (single recipient, plain or HTML)
POST https://api.mailbaby.net/mail/send
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
